{"4705870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Single Note", "steam_appid": 4705870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4932390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Note is an atmospheric first-person adventure set in an alternative retro world where music has become a source of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone dreams of a better future — and our main character is no exception. One day, he finally finds the courage to leave the nest where he has lived alone for so long and sets off toward the flying city — a place that promises a beautiful tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705870/extras/2275a2696fba950463eecd8bdaed77ef.avif?t=1784048180\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may wonder: how can a city fly? In an ordinary world, it cannot. But the world of this story is a special case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, music has been turned into energy. Thanks to it, people created incredible inventions that spark the imagination. But on the road to the city, it becomes clear that many of these wonders now stand empty. Not everyone can endure the endless music of their engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705870/extras/0fe5ea36398423f66a9ca8888ca01705.avif?t=1784048180\" width=1280 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a beautiful retro world, overcome obstacles and harsh weather — and reach the flying city in your own musical vehicle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Note is an atmospheric first-person adventure set in an alternative retro world where music has become a source of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone dreams of a better future — and our main character is no exception. One day, he finally finds the courage to leave the nest where he has lived alone for so long and sets off toward the flying city — a place that promises a beautiful tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705870/extras/2275a2696fba950463eecd8bdaed77ef.avif?t=1784048180\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may wonder: how can a city fly? In an ordinary world, it cannot. But the world of this story is a special case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, music has been turned into energy. Thanks to it, people created incredible inventions that spark the imagination. But on the road to the city, it becomes clear that many of these wonders now stand empty. Not everyone can endure the endless music of their engines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705870/extras/0fe5ea36398423f66a9ca8888ca01705.avif?t=1784048180\" width=1280 height=802 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a beautiful retro world, overcome obstacles and harsh weather — and reach the flying city in your own musical vehicle.</p>", "short_description": "An atmospheric first-person driving adventure through a strange retro world filled with music, mystery, and psychological tension.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4705870/fd2495acfc34d5942076d31492786d81603d73b5/header.jpg?t=1784048